This is a modified version of Toolbox that supports .jarc, .jmdl, and .jtex files. These filetypes mostly appear in games developed by Ganbarion. (Several One Piece games, Wii Fit U, etc.)
You will need to use the .jarc quickBMS script to extract assets from a .jarc file. In the case of Wii Fit U, they've been renamed to .carc, for whatever reason.


This fork was originally created by a user who has since taken their accounts offline, with additional updates by showstopper3934.
